title: Bring the Rim Home
subtitle: The Rimward road: win back the worlds the Confederacy promised to free.
is-card: true
tags: caucus_affairs
card-image: img/card_rim.svg
view-if: wroad_timer <= 0 and road_card_ok and rc_lead = "rimward"
on-arrival: turn_actions += 1; wroad_timer = 2; last_card_timer = "wroad"
new-page: true
on-display: {! SW.cardStuck(Q, this); !}

= Bring the Rim Home

The Rimward wing knows that Dooku's Confederacy is not a fortress but a promise: that the Rim will never be heard on Coruscant. Keep the Republic's promise instead, and the Confederacy can be emptied world by world.

- @congress: Convene an Outer Rim Congress.
- @charter: Put the Rim Charter to the Senate.
- @homecoming: Invite the seceded worlds home.
- @easy_discard
- @set_aside

@congress
view-if: road_rimward = 0
subtitle: −1 political capital. Rim relations +8, hardship −3, separatism in the Outer and Mid Rim −5.
choose-if: capital >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough political capital.
on-arrival: {! SW.roadStep(Q, 'rimward', 1); !}

Delegates from four hundred Rim worlds meet on Ord Mantell, many of them for the first time in a hall where the Republic is listening. They leave with a list of demands, and with the sense that someone wrote them down.

@charter
view-if: road_rimward = 1
subtitle: −2 political capital. Needs the Rim enfranchised or the Rim Relief Act. Separatism −10, and Dooku's cause grows at half speed.
choose-if: capital >= 2 and (rim_enfranchised or rim_relief_act) and date >= road_wait_rimward
unavailable-subtitle: [? if not rim_enfranchised and not rim_relief_act : The Rim will not believe a charter until it has its seats or its relief. ?][? if rim_enfranchised or rim_relief_act : [? if date < road_wait_rimward : The Senate has just voted it down. ?][? if date >= road_wait_rimward : Needs 2 political capital. ?] ?]
on-arrival: {! SW.roadStep(Q, 'rimward', 2); !}

[+ vote_html +]

[? if road_ok : The Rim Charter passes: the Rim's rights written into the Republic's law, beyond the reach of the next Chancellor. On a hundred Rim worlds, Dooku's recruiters find their halls emptier. ?][? if not road_ok : The Charter fails. The Rim notes who voted against it. ?]

@homecoming
view-if: road_rimward = 2
subtitle: −1 political capital. Needs the Rim Charter and slavery abolished. The seceded worlds return over a year.
choose-if: capital >= 1 and rim_charter and slavery_abolished
unavailable-subtitle: [? if not slavery_abolished : No world will come home to a Republic that still tolerates slavery. ?][? if slavery_abolished : Not enough political capital. ?]
on-arrival: {! SW.roadStep(Q, 'rimward', 3); !}

The Caucus sends its envoys to every world that left: no reprisals, the Charter's rights, and a seat waiting in the Senate. [? if war : Some answer the same week, and the Confederacy's fleets lose their harbours. ?][? if not war : Some answer the same week. Dooku's movement has never looked so thin. ?]
